All aboard the ABC Train!

2
00:00:16,333 --> 00:00:20,266
A for Apple, B for Ball,

3
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:24,166
C for Cat climbing up the wall!

4
00:00:24,533 --> 00:00:28,300
D for Dog, E for Elephant gray,

5
00:00:28,866 --> 00:00:32,333
F for Fish swimming away!

6
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:36,366
G, H, I, J, K and L,

7
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:40,333
