18
00:01:21,566 --> 00:01:29,300
U, V, W, X, Y, Z, Now we know the letters, you and me!

19
00:01:29,666 --> 00:01:33,366
Every letter has a friendly sound,

20
00:01:33,466 --> 00:01:37,366
Spelling all the magic words around!

21
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:41,533
Chugga-chugga choo-choo, hear the bell ring,

22
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:44,666
Singing out our letters while we sing, sing, sing!

23
00:01:45,766 --> 00:01:49,466
Riding down the track from A to Z,

24
00:01:49,866 --> 00:01:53,666
Learning all the letters happily!

25
